This licence covers the source code of Thor's Kist only.

Thor's Kist is an unofficial modification for Valheim. It is not affiliated
with, endorsed by, or supported by Iron Gate Studio or Coffee Stain
Publishing. Valheim and its assets remain their property.

Building this mod requires reference assemblies from Valheim and Unity. Those
are NOT distributed here -- scripts/setup-refs.sh collects them from your own
installed copy of the game. Do not commit them.

Third-party components this mod depends on at runtime, neither of which is
distributed in this repository:

  BepInEx  -- LGPL-2.1        https://github.com/BepInEx/BepInEx
  HarmonyX -- MIT             https://github.com/BepInEx/HarmonyX
